WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:21.965
Eddy saw his friends at school.

2
00:00:21.966 --> 00:00:33.467
"Hi, Eddy!" called Poppy.

3
00:00:33.468 --> 00:00:38.036
Honk! Honk! She tooted her horn.

4
00:00:38.036 --> 00:00:40.550
Eddy laughed.

5
00:00:40.549 --> 00:00:46.906
Poppy was always silly.

6
00:00:46.907 --> 00:00:49.875
"Field trip today," said Dipper.

7
00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:52.886
"Yay!" said Poppy.

8
00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.679
"Where are we going?"

9
00:00:55.679 --> 00:01:01.131
"Maybe to a construction site," said Jeb.

10
00:01:01.131 --> 00:01:04.091
Eddy saw the teacher.

11
00:01:04.091 --> 00:01:07.707
"Good morning," said Mr. Grill.

12
00:01:07.707 --> 00:01:10.727
"Ready for our field trip?"

13
00:01:10.727 --> 00:01:13.460
"Yes!" said Poppy.

14
00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:16.634
"Where are we going?" asked Zippy.

15
00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:20.295
"It's a surprise," said Mr. Grill.

16
00:01:20.295 --> 00:01:22.993
"Everyone, follow me!"

17
00:01:22.994 --> 00:01:27.784
"Yay!" the students cheered.

18
00:01:27.785 --> 00:01:40.586
Honk! Honk! Vroom!

19
00:01:40.586 --> 00:01:49.917
They turned into a parking lot.

20
00:01:49.918 --> 00:01:53.668
Eddy saw a blue building.

21
00:01:53.668 --> 00:01:57.010
The building was noisy.

22
00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:00.713
A sign said Car Wash.

23
00:02:00.713 --> 00:02:03.209
Mr. Grill smiled.

24
00:02:03.209 --> 00:02:08.821
"It's bath time!"

